{
  "name": "manju-flow",
  "version": "1.1.0",
  "description": "漫剧一条龙（Manju Flow）：DSH 全功能插件，承接 shuangwen-novel 爽文小说创作管线 + 自研 H3 漫剧渲染引擎，一条龙直出「小说 → 视频」。Host：21 个 manju_* 工具 + manjuConsole Remote 服务；Client：侧栏「漫剧」多标签管理台（总览/监控/小说/项目/渲染/风格/设置）。零 NiliX 依赖，直连 ComfyUI + DeepSeek + FFmpeg。",
  "type": "commonjs",
  "main": "index.js",
  "license": "MIT",
  "author": "YiIimini",
  "keywords": [
    "dsh-plugin",
    "deepseek-harness",
    "cordis",
    "novel",
    "manju",
    "h3",
    "minimax",
    "comfyui",
    "video",
    "aigc",
    "漫剧",
    "小说"
  ],
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "https://github.com/YiIimini/manju-flow.git"
  },
  "bugs": {
    "url": "https://github.com/YiIimini/manju-flow/issues"
  },
  "homepage": "https://github.com/YiIimini/manju-flow#readme",
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "platform": "web",
      "inject": [
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-runtime",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-api-remotes"
      ]
    }
  },
  "exports": {
    ".": "./index.js",
    "./client": "./client.js",
    "./cordis.patch.yml": "./cordis.patch.yml",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  }
}
